WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,940 --> 00:00:01,940
This immortality

2
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:03,940
Why are you so rich now?

3
00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:07,200
Then I'm back from immortality

4
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,330
Is this going to make a fortune?

5
00:00:09,330 --> 00:00:11,330
Your cousin wants to see his wife after the Chinese New Year

6
00:00:11,330 --> 00:00:14,970
Look, the woman wants a gift of two hundred yuan.

7
00:00:14,970 --> 00:00:15,970
Can I borrow twenty-two hundred yuan?

8
00:00:15,970 --> 00:00:19,830
No time to respond to an emergency

9
00:00:19,830 --> 00:00:20,830
Li Changsheng, what do you say?

10
00:00:20,830 --> 00:00:21,830
Elders, please lend me some money

11
00:00:21,830 --> 00:00:22,830
You still don’t recognize the six thousand?

12
00:00:22,830 --> 00:00:36,690
In the past, when Su Yu went to my house to borrow food, I returned it.

13
00:00:36,690 --> 00:00:39,070
Su Yu used to go to your house to borrow food.

14
00:00:39,070 --> 00:00:40,070
You didn't even let me in

15
00:00:40,070 --> 00:00:42,100
Now come and catch the autumn wind

16
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:44,100
Who do you think you are?

17
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:46,580
Touch my things again

18
00:00:46,580 --> 00:00:47,650
I chopped off your hand

19
00:00:47,650 --> 00:00:48,650
Desperate beast

20
00:00:48,650 --> 00:01:09,890
Liu Qian came back without recognizing him
